SUMMARY:Pokémon GO: Mega Ascension
DESCRIPTION:Mega Ascension week prior to the Mega Finale event. Accumulate Mega Energy from weekly raids.\n\nDaily Mega Raid Rotation:\n- Monday, Aug 31: Mega Venusaur, Mega Charizard X/Y & Mega Blastoise.\n- Tuesday, Sep 1: Mega Pidgeot, Mega Beedrill & Mega Slowbro.\n- Wednesday, Sep 2: Mega Houndoom, Mega Manectric & Mega Altaria.\n- Thursday, Sep 3: Mega Gengar, Mega Banette & Mega Absol.\n- Friday, Sep 4: Mega Latios, Mega Latias & Mega Rayquaza.\n\nEvent Bonuses:\n- Up to 2 free Raid Passes per day.\n- 1.5x Mega Energy from Raids.
END:VEVENT
