SUMMARY:Pokémon GO Fest: Mega Finale (Day 1 - Mega-Mewtwo X)
DESCRIPTION:Global Event. Main Raids: Mega-Mewtwo X.\n\nHabitat Rotation (Local Time):\n- 10:00 to 11:00 & 14:00 to 15:00: Verdant Lush\n- 11:00 to 12:00 & 15:00 to 16:00: Mindworks Channel\n- 12:00 to 13:00 & 16:00 to 17:00: Haunting Alley\n- 13:00 to 14:00 & 17:00 to 18:00: Circuit Plaza\n\nBonuses: Unlimited remote raids. Special Backgrounds available.
END:VEVENT
