SUMMARY:Super Mega Raid Day
DESCRIPTION:Special Super Mega Raid Day!\n\nHuge rotation of Raid Bosses appearing frequently:\n- Gyarados\n- Beedrill\n- Houndoom\n- Venusaur\n- Malamar\n- Victreebel\n\nBonuses:\n- Increased Shiny odds for featured Pokémon.\n- 5 extra free Raid Passes from Gyms.
