SUMMARY:Raids: Zacian, Zamazenta & Shadow Thundurus
DESCRIPTION:Legendary Raids Update!\n\n- Zacian and Zamazenta return to 5-star raids with their shiny variants enabled.\n- Exclusive debut of Shadow Incarnate Forme Thundurus during weekend Shadow Raids (Saturdays and Sundays only).\n\nMake sure to use Campfire to coordinate with your local community!
